---
// src/pages/disclaimer.astro
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Verdant Notes' content and affiliate disclaimer: how we handle accuracy, sponsored content, and affiliate or earnings relationships."
  currentPath="/disclaimer"
  noindex={true}
>
  <div class="container">
    <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Disclaimer' }]} />

    <div class="legal-page">
      <h1>Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: September 4, 2026</p>

      <p>The information on this website (verdantnotes.example) is published by Verdant Notes Media in good faith and for general informational purposes only. This page explains the limits of that information and how we handle sponsored or affiliate relationships.</p>

      <h2>1. Content accuracy</h2>
      <p>While we do our best to keep information up to date and correct, we make no representations or warranties of any kind, express or implied, about the completeness, accuracy, reliability, or availability of any information on the Site. Any reliance you place on such information is strictly at your own risk. Technology, pricing, and product details in particular can change quickly after publication.</p>

      <h2>2. Not professional advice</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this Site constitutes legal, financial, medical, or other professional advice. Articles reflect the views and research of individual authors — see full author credentials on our <a href="/sam/team">Editorial Team page</a> — and should not be treated as a substitute for advice from a qualified professional familiar with your specific situation.</p>

      <h2>3. Affiliate and earnings disclosure</h2>
      <p>Some posts on Verdant Notes may contain affiliate links. If you click one of these links and make a purchase, we may earn a small commission at no additional cost to you. This does not influence which products or services we choose to write about, and we only recommend things we would use ourselves. Where a post includes affiliate links, this is disclosed at the top of that post.</p>
      <p>Verdant Notes is also a participant in the Google AdSense program, which places advertising on the Site. Advertisements are clearly labeled and are separated from editorial content; the presence of an ad does not imply Verdant Notes' endorsement of the advertiser or their product.</p>

      <h2>4. Sponsored content</h2>
      <p>Any sponsored post or paid partnership is clearly labeled as "Sponsored" at the top of the article, in line with FTC guidance on endorsements and testimonials. Sponsors have no editorial control over the content or opinions expressed.</p>

      <h2>5. External links</h2>
      <p>The Site may contain links to external websites that are not provided or maintained by us. We do not guarantee the accuracy, relevance, timeliness, or completeness of any information on these external websites, and linking to them does not imply endorsement.</p>

      <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>Under no circumstances shall Verdant Notes be liable for any loss or damage of any kind incurred as a result of the use of the Site or reliance on any information provided. Use of the Site and reliance on any information is solely at your own risk.</p>

      <h2>7. Contact us</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this disclaimer, please reach out via our <a href="/sam/contact">Contact page</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
